---
import { CHAPTERS, chapterHref } from '../data/chapters';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const archiveLinks = CHAPTERS.filter((chapter) => ['01', '03', '05', '06', '08'].includes(chapter.number));
---

<footer id="kontak" class="w-full bg-surface-container-low pt-16 pb-12 mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <img
          alt="Logo KLP Kelampaian"
          class="h-8 w-auto object-contain"
          src="/images/logo-klp-kelampaian.webp"
          width="160"
          height="106"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <span class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface text-base">KLP Kelampaian</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        Platform Portofolio Digital Impact: Mengangkat harkat ekonomi lokal dan melestarikan ekologi rawa gambut
        melalui tata kelola rumbia serta sagu terintegrasi di Kalimantan Selatan.
      </p>
      <p class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container p-3 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined mt-0.5 text-[16px] text-primary" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
        <span>Data penerima manfaat, kutipan testimoni, dan dokumentasi lapangan diverifikasi bersama aparatur desa setempat.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider font-headline">Sekretariat &amp; Lokasi</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        Desa Kelampaian Ilir, RT 02 / RW 01, Kecamatan Astambul, Kabupaten Banjar, Kalimantan Selatan, Kode Pos 70672
      </p>
      <a
        class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors"
        href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary" aria-hidden="true">mail</span>
        <span>{SITE.email}</span>
      </a>
      <a
        class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors"
        href={SITE.whatsappUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        <svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 fill-current text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z" />
        </svg>
        <span>WhatsApp {SITE.whatsapp} (Mislaini)</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider font-headline">Struktur Dampak &amp; Arsip</h2>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
        {
          archiveLinks.map((chapter) => (
            <li>
              <a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href={chapterHref(chapter)}>
                {chapter.cardTitle}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider font-headline">Aksi &amp; Dukungan</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        Dukung perluasan dampak hilirisasi rumbia dan pemberdayaan pemuda pengrajin di Kabupaten Banjar.
      </p>
      <a
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-on-primary shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-primary-container hover:text-on-primary-container"
        href="/keberlanjutan-dan-kolaborasi/#kolaborasi"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">volunteer_activism</span>
        <span>Dukung Gerakan / Hubungi Kami</span>
      </a>
      <a
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary hover:underline"
        href="/keberlanjutan-dan-kolaborasi/"
      >
        <span>Peta kolaborasi &amp; rencana 2026-2030</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 pt-8 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-on-surface-variant"
  >
    <p>© 2026 Koleksi Lokal Produk Kelampaian (KLP Kelampaian). Seluruh Hak Cipta Dilindungi.</p>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
      <span>Kabupaten Banjar, Kalsel</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">•</span>
      <span>Inisiatif Kepemudaan Banua</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
